#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:27
#: e458ab5012694e90b77f682e2f386fbb
msgid ""
"You can display video from your aircraft on the Mission Planner's HUD if you"
" are digitizing it with the same laptop (with a video capture card or USB "
"device). Just select the device in the Configuration/Planner screen, chose "
"video format and press \"Start\" to begin recording. If you select the HUD "
"checkbox, the video display will replace the artificial horizon in the HUD."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用同一台笔记本电脑（配备视频采集卡或 USB 设备）对飞机视频进行数字化处理，可在 Mission Planner 的 HUD "
"上显示飞机视频。只需在「Configuration/Planner」界面中选择设备、选择视频格式，并点击「Start」开始录制即可。若勾选「HUD」复选框，视频画面将替换"
" HUD 中的人工地平线显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:33
#: 3a61c54f8a674a68a30a0b9456bce1a8
msgid ""
"You can also record the video that you're displaying to an AVI file. Just "
"right-click in the HUD and choose from the menu that will pop up."
msgstr "您还可以将正在显示的视频录制为 AVI 文件。只需在 HUD 中单击鼠标右键，然后从弹出菜单中选择相应选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:36
#: 9c22bb9fd47946409bb737a8e3aeb002
msgid ""
"You can send NMEA (GPS) output to the serial port. Press control-g and you "
"will get a box asking for a comport and baud rate to output standard NMEA "
"data at 2 Hz, to any serial port. One application would be to use com2com to"
" emulate a serial port to use with third party applications."
msgstr ""
"您可以将 NMEA（GPS）输出发送到串口。按下 Ctrl-G 后，会弹出一个对话框，要求输入串口号和波特率，以 2 Hz 的频率向任意串口输出标准 "
"NMEA 数据。一种应用场景是使用 com2com 模拟串口，以供第三方应用程序使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:41
#: be89801260f54be283f27d7401109db1
msgid ""
"You can have the Mission Planner load non-standard firmware (any .hex files "
"that you've made or got elsewhere) to APM by pressing Control-C on the "
"firmware loading screen."
msgstr ""
"您可以在固件烧录界面按下 Ctrl-C，让 Mission Planner 向 APM 加载非标准固件（您自己制作或从其他途径获取的任何 .hex "
"文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:44
#: ec76779f4f1448c1af037f59985a051e
msgid ""
"Mission Planner can give you audio speech alerts for events that you choose,"
" such as hitting waypoints or low battery. Just go to **Configuration \\| "
"Planner \\| Speech \\| Enable Speech**"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 可以为您选择的事件提供语音报警，例如到达航点或电池电量低。只需前往 **Configuration \\| "
"Planner \\| Speech \\| Enable Speech** 进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/other-mission-planner-features.rst:47
#: 3b87db0d136d4e2e8fe3873649623497
msgid ""
"Mission Planner can be scripted - see :ref:`Using Python Scripts in Mission "
"Planner <using-python-scripts-in-mission-planner>` (planner wiki)"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 支持脚本编程——详见 :ref:`在 Mission Planner 中使用 Python 脚本 <using-"
"python-scripts-in-mission-planner>` （planner wiki）"
